msgstr "Entregatu aurretik fakturatu ditzakezu."

#. module: sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale/models/sale_order.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can not delete a sent quotation or a confirmed sales order. You must "
"first cancel it."
msgstr ""
"Ezin dituzu bidalitako aurrekontuak edo berretsitako salmenta-eskaerak ezabatu. Bertan behera utzi behar dituzu lehenik."

#. module: sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale/models/sale_order_line.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can not remove an order line once the sales order is confirmed.\n"
"You should rather set the quantity to 0."
msgstr ""
"Ezin dituzu eskaera-lerroak ezabatu haiek berretsi ondoren.\n"
"Horren ordez, ezarri kopurua 0 gisa."

#. module: sale
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:sale.action_orders_to_invoice
msgid ""
"You can select all orders and invoice them in batch,<br>\n"
"            or check every order and invoice them one by one."
msgstr ""
"Eskaera guztiak hautatu eta elkarrekin fakturatu ditzakezu,<br>\n"
"                baita haiek banaka berrikusi eta fakturatu ere."

#. module: sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale.field_payment_provider__so_reference_type
msgid ""
"You can set here the communication type that will appear on sales orders.The"
" communication will be given to the customer when they choose the payment "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Salmenta-eskaeretan agertuko den jakinarazpen-mota hemen ezar dezakezu. Bezeroak ordainketa-metodoa aukeratzen duenean egingo zaio jakinarazpena."

#. module: sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale/models/product_product.py:0
#: code:addons/sale/models/product_template.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You cannot change the product's type because it is already used in sales "
"orders."
msgstr ""
"Ezin duzu produktu-mota aldatu, salmenta-eskaera batean erabiltzen ari delako."

#. module: sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale/models/sale_order_line.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You cannot change the type of a sale order line. Instead you should delete "
"the current line and create a new line of the proper type."
msgstr ""
"Ezin duzu salmenta-eskaeren lerro-mota aldatu. Horren ordez, ezabatu uneko lerroa eta ordeztu lerro-mota egoki batekin."

#. module: sale
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:sale.product_template_action
msgid ""
"You must define a product for everything you sell or purchase,\n"
"                whether it's a storable product, a consumable or a service."
msgstr ""
"Saltzen eta erosten duzun guztiaren produktua definitu behar duzu,\n"
"                produktu pilagarria, kontsumigarria edo zerbitzu bat bada ere."

